note The one way a step is added from the GUI. Needs a tour being read; the parent is the target, or the step a graph node hangs from, dropped when its slot is gone. The same file and lines under the same parent are refused with that step's number (AlreadyStep); otherwise Map::add_step pins it, authored Human, the map is marked unsaved and the status names the new number and where it went. The selection and the target stay where they were.

