file crates/domain/src/map.rs
symbol place
lines 0 27
hash aad3a952e039e99d
note The map's move: reparent (which refuses a step under itself), then walk the step through the list with swap_places until it sits just before the given step, or at the end. Each swap_places exchanges two neighbours' places and orders, so only the steps it passes change their order lines.

